  "integration_notes": [
    "Create independent furnace and crafting station objects. The rug and mats are separate ground sprites, with no blocking collider.",
    "Keep deliveries and outputs as runtime item objects. Neither mat has baked stock. Keep stock piles within their pad so the aisle stays clear.",
    "Use independent station level fields and replace only the matching sprite/glow. Preserve receiver/container IDs and saves using the existing game logic.",
    "Do not block the entire 4x3 group footprint; it reserves placement space but most of it is walkable.",
    "Use each station ground pivot for actor depth sorting. Render its glow immediately above it, without the silhouette-outline effect.",
    "The existing IsoMap maps positive cells upward on screen; this pack UV maps downward. The included cell deltas swap and negate UV deltas. Account for Ridge height through the existing IsoMap API.",
    "This pack supersedes the roofed 3x2 art direction. Recommended floor is now 4x3 to retain a full-tile aisle with separate stations."
  ]
